Description: Nodes for statistical models in a trama graph: linear and
    generalized linear models from columns or a typed formula; analysis of
    variance for the classical experimental designs (completely randomized,
    randomized blocks, latin square, factorial and split plot) with type I, II
    and III sums of squares; linear mixed models with lme4 and lmerTest;
    estimated marginal means, compact letter displays and pairwise or
    Dunnett comparisons with emmeans; Duncan, Waller-Duncan and Scott-Knott
    grouping; effect sizes and coefficient forest plots; residual diagnostics
    and assumption tests; and the classical hypothesis tests with the Dunn
    post hoc. Every p-value is shown on a
    logarithmic gauge with significance stars. Builds on trama.data for
    tables and trama.view for plots.
